# Bestow is an alternative cost (CR 702.103a, 118.9): the bestowed Aura spell keeps the card's mana cost (CR 702.103b), so
# a Detective's Phoenix cast for its bestow cost {R} has mana value 3, its {2}{R}'s (CR 202.3). Bot2's Chalice of the Void
# with one charge counter ("counter a spell with mana value equal to the number of charge counters") lets it resolve,
# and the Aura on Bot1's Ornithopter is mana value 3 on the battlefield too. It keeps its other characteristics, flying and
# haste among them (CR 702.103b).

